      "message": "\u003e IMHO, we either must create a `BinaryResult` which doesn\u0027t depend on the repository being open or we have to stream the result from within this try-finally block i.e. before the repositoyr is closed.\n\nI believe it makes sense to just reopen the repo in the `BinaryResult` instead of reusing the repository.",
